---
// 核心特性：用可读的产品界面代替纯文字卡片。
---

<section id="features" class="features-section">
  <div class="features-shell">
    <header class="features-heading reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="section-eyebrow">核心特性 <span>01 — 04</span></p>
        <h2>把模糊的想法，<br /><em>变成可掌控的执行。</em></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="features-intro">Looper 把对话、工作流与运行权限放在同一条清晰的路径上。每一步看得见，也始终由你决定下一步。</p>
    </header>

    <div class="feature-bento">
      <article class="feature-card feature-command reveal-scale">
        <div class="feature-card-top">
          <div><span class="feature-kicker"><b>01</b> 从意图开始</span><h3>一句话，先生成<br />可编辑的工作流</h3></div>
          <span class="feature-status"><i></i> Draft ready</span>
        </div>
        <div class="command-demo" aria-label="工作流草稿示例">
          <div class="command-window-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><p>new-workflow.loop</p><small>⌘ K</small></div>
          <div class="command-prompt"><span class="command-avatar">你</span><p>汇总最近 3 天的 PR，整理成今日团队日报</p><span class="command-send">↵</span></div>
          <div class="workflow-preview">
            <div class="workflow-preview-head"><span>LOOPER 已为你搭好草稿</span><span>4 NODES</span></div>
            <div class="feature-workflow-track">
              <div class="feature-workflow-node active"><i>01</i><span>读取 PR</span></div><div class="feature-workflow-line"></div>
              <div class="feature-workflow-node"><i>02</i><span>提炼变更</span></div><div class="feature-workflow-line"></div>
              <div class="feature-workflow-node"><i>03</i><span>生成日报</span></div><div class="feature-workflow-line faint"></div>
              <div class="feature-workflow-node pending"><i>04</i><span>发送确认</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="command-footer"><span>已保存为草稿</span><button type="button">检查并发布 <b>→</b></button></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card feature-control reveal-scale">
        <div class="feature-card-top"><div><span class="feature-kicker"><b>02</b> 边界清晰</span><h3>权限不藏在<br />黑盒里</h3></div><span class="control-shield">✦</span></div>
        <p class="feature-description">运行始终在本地。你可以为每一个动作保留确认，也可以按工作流设置自动执行范围。</p>
        <div class="permission-list">
          <div><span class="permission-icon folder">⌁</span><p><b>项目文件</b><small>仅本次工作区</small></p><span class="permission-state">允许</span></div>
          <div><span class="permission-icon terminal">›_</span><p><b>Shell 命令</b><small>每次运行前确认</small></p><span class="permission-state review">询问</span></div>
          <div><span class="permission-icon network">↗</span><p><b>外部服务</b><small>按你的 Provider 设置</small></p><span class="permission-state">允许</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card feature-canvas reveal-scale">
        <div class="feature-card-top"><div><span class="feature-kicker"><b>03</b> 过程可见</span><h3>像搭积木一样<br />组织每一步</h3></div><span class="canvas-label">CANVAS</span></div>
        <p class="feature-description">顺序、并行、循环和条件分支，都能在画布上直接看懂、调整和复用。</p>
        <div class="canvas-map" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 128" preserveAspectRatio="none">
            <path d="M52 64 H140 C156 64 156 30 176 30 H208" />
            <path d="M52 64 H140 C156 64 156 98 176 98 H208" />
            <path d="M208 30 H326 V64 H350" />
            <path d="M208 98 H326 V64" />
          </svg>
          <div class="map-node map-start">输入</div><div class="map-node map-agent">Agent<br /><small>分析</small></div><div class="map-node map-loop">Loop<br /><small>校验</small></div><div class="map-node map-output">输出</div>
        </div>
        <div class="canvas-footer"><span><i></i> 结构校验通过</span><span>保存为模板 ↗</span></div>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card feature-modes reveal-scale">
        <div class="feature-card-top"><div><span class="feature-kicker"><b>04</b> 各司其职</span><h3>为任务选择<br />合适的执行方式</h3></div><span class="modes-count">03<br /><small>modes</small></span></div>
        <div class="mode-stack">
          <div class="mode-row agent"><span class="mode-dot"></span><b>Agent</b><p>推理、对话与工具调用</p><i>↗</i></div>
          <div class="mode-row shell"><span class="mode-dot"></span><b>Shell</b><p>本地文件、代码与命令</p><i>↗</i></div>
          <div class="mode-row loop"><span class="mode-dot"></span><b>Loop</b><p>按标准反复评估改进</p><i>↗</i></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
